cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ST131Finder, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "ST131Finder"
abstract: >-
  A single-file browser tool that assigns Escherichia coli ST131 clade by in silico
  PCR without relying on the ybbW marker, reports every isolate under all five
  published ST131 nomenclatures, and returns MLST, fimH, O:H serotype, QRDR
  genotype and acquired resistance genes in the same pass. All computation runs
  in the browser; sequence data never leaves the operator's machine.
type: software
